    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "MM Ward Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 5 Beasley House, a bright and spacious ground floor apartment ideally positioned within the popular and well maintained Punchestown Gate development, just off the Dublin Road in Naas.\n\nPunchestown Gate is a mature and leafy development, ideally located just off the Dublin Road and within easy walking distance of Naas town centre.\n\nNo.5 Beasley House is situated on the ground floor of a two storey apartment block and offers well proportioned accommodation throughout.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall, a spacious open-plan kitchen, living and dining area, two generous double bedrooms and a main bathroom. \nThe open-plan living space provides a bright and comfortable area for both relaxing and entertaining, with the kitchen conveniently positioned off the living and dining area.\n\nThe property would make an excellent home for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors, offering spacious accommodation in a highly convenient location.\n\nThe location is superb, with Naas Main Street approximately a five minute walk away, offering a wide selection of shops, boutiques, restaurants, cafés, bars and leisure facilities. Naas Hospital and the town theatre are also within easy reach.\n\nFor commuters, the M7 motorway is just over 2 km away, while Sallins Train Station is less than a 10-minute drive, providing convenient access to Dublin and surrounding areas.\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to appreciate all that this spacious apartment and its excellent location have to offer.\n\nViewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 11'2\" (3.4m) x 8'5\" (2.57m)\nGrey oak laminate flooring, Hot press, Large storage cupboard with power sockets\n\nLiving/Dining Room - 20'0\" (6.1m) x 11'4\" (3.45m)\nLight filled, Spacious, Open to kitchen\n\nKitchen - 8'11\" (2.72m) x 8'7\" (2.62m)\nTiled flooring & part tiled walls, Fully fitted kitchen with plenty of storage, Oven, Hob, Extractor fan, Washing machine, Dryer, Fridge freezer.\n\nBedroom 1 - 12'10\" (3.91m) x 11'4\" (3.45m)\nGenerous Double Room with laminate flooring\n\nBedroom 2 - 11'6\" (3.51m) x 7'10\" (2.39m)\nBuilt-in wardrobes and laminate flooring\n\nBathroom - 7'8\" (2.34m) x 6'7\" (2.01m)\nWC, WHB, Shower cabinet with electric shower.Fully tiled, Panelled ceiling\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
